    "body": "## G3 cabinet variants (C0–C5 + review fixes) — NOT FUSION-VERIFIED\n\nDraft PR. Base `feature/v5-fusion-adapter`; **do not merge** (G3 real-Fusion tests F0–F3 are NOT RUN; PR #3 is also unmerged).\n\n- C0 golden snapshots + protected-source hashes; C1 strict 0.1/0.2 loader + data-only base/tall/overhead@1 profiles; C2 live profile range checks; C3 `entities.managed_ids` census; C4 runner integration + `specs/*.json`; C5 read-only G3 cut audit + `FUSION_TEST_PROTOCOL_G3.md`.\n- Review fixes: audit flags every unexpected `dado.*` feature; `input_spec_raw_sha256` vs `stored_spec_raw_sha256` labelled correctly.\n- Verified cabinet geometry/protected files byte-identical (hash-tested). `main`, `develop`, `feature/v5-fusion-adapter` untouched.\n- Offline evidence only: 109 prototype + 5 foundation tests (Py 3.11/3.12/3.13 local); GitHub Actions 3.10 and 3.12 green on `4d4345b`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BNktbetC89Ui8y1XigWVVE\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01BNktbetC89Ui8y1XigWVVE)_",
